# Tooling Agents (dev-only)

Before claiming an MCP tool is available, read `.agents/tooling-flags.json` and the live tool catalog.

| Need | Prefer | Fallback |
|------|--------|----------|
| Library/API docs | Context7 | `docs/` + WebSearch |
| Browser QA | Chrome DevTools MCP | Manual DevTools checklist; redact secrets |
| DB inspect | DBHub readonly / DBCode | `backend/database.py` + sqlite CLI |
| Symbol refactor | Serena | Grep/Glob/Read |
| UI primitives | Existing shadcn `components/ui` | Do not restyle SOC theme |
| Architecture docs | `docs/` + `docs/knowledge/` | — |
| Visual polish | UI Quality skill | WCAG checklist |
| Memory | `.agents/memory/` | — |

## Hard rules

1. Application runtime must work with **zero** MCP servers.
2. Never log cookies, tokens, passwords, API keys, private audio, or transcripts.
3. No destructive DB ops without explicit user confirmation.
4. Preserve VoxGuard navy/orange SOC identity; shadcn is additive only.
5. After meaningful changes, update CodeMem worklog (no secrets).
6. Agent registry: `.agents/AGENT_REGISTRY.md`
